   Abella, Scott R., Univ Nevada, Sch Life Sci, Las Vegas, NV 89154 USA.
   Covington, W. Wallace; Fule, Peter Z., No Arizona Univ, Sch Forestry, Flagstaff, AZ 86011 USA.
   Lentile, Leigh B.; Morgan, Penelope, Univ Idaho, Dept Forest Resources, Moscow, ID 83843 USA.},
