   St-Louis, Evelyne; El-Geneidy, Ahmed, McGill Univ, Sch Urban Planning, Montreal, PQ H3A 2K6, Canada.
   Manaugh, Kevin, Dept Geog, Montreal, PQ H3A 2K6, Canada.
   Manaugh, Kevin, McGill Sch Environm, Montreal, PQ H3A 2K6, Canada.
   van Lierop, Dea, McGill Univ, Sch Urban Planning, Montreal, PQ H3A 0C2, Canada.},
DOI = {10.1016/j.trf.2014.07.004},
