   Bodin Danielsson, Christina, KTH Royal Inst Technol, Sch Architecture \& Built Environm, Stockholm, Sweden.
   Pareigis, Jorg, Karlstad Univ, Serv Res Ctr, CTF, Karlstad Business Sch, Karlstad, Sweden.},
DOI = {10.1108/JMP-09-2019-0534},
EarlyAccessDate = {DEC 2020},
ISSN = {0268-3946},
EISSN = {1758-7778},
Keywords = {Office type; Cellular office; Shared-room office; Open-plan office;
